    "instruction": "The user has a question about experimental design or protocol for TB research. Answer with the specificity of someone who has worked under BSL-3 conditions.",
    "input": "I wanna investigate the impact of Rv1987 on host cytokine responses and T cell polarization in mouse aerosol model. How do I do that?",
